WEBVTT

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:05.850
With one win and one loss, You Show 
School faced LDS in the third match.

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:14.660
Gongenzaka helped us and used his Immovable Duel style 
to withstand Synchro user Yaiba Toudou's fierce attack.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:17.850
3300 points of damage!

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:24.500
Their match ended in a draw.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.300
I thought LDS couldn't take You Show 
School anymore because they didn't win.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:38.500
But LDS Chairwoman Himika Akaba 
demanded an additional match.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:45.150
We begrudgingly accepted, and 
Yuya will duel for our side.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:51.600
LDS Fusion user Masumi Koutsu was supposed 
to face him because she defeated Yuzu, but...

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.270
I'll face him.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.900
He wore his goggles.

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:07.550
What's up?

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:08.950
Yuya...

00:01:08.950 --> 00:01:10.050
Yuya...

00:01:10.450 --> 00:01:15.400
The man Gongenzaka knows 
he was a disappointment.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:21.600
If I won, Yuya wouldn't be 
facing unnecessary pressure!

00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:23.500
Oh really?

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:28.270
It doesn't look like he's 
feeling any pressure at all.

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:32.850
It looks like he really wants 
to battle and is ready to fight.

00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:36.250
This is the real final match!

00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:41.500
I promise to win and protect this 
school and my father's dueling style!

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:43.150
Yuya...

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:46.550
That's right!  Yuya will definitely win!

00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:49.660
Because we have Pendulum Summon on our side!

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:52.300
That's right!  Pendulum won't lose!

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:55.450
Yuya nor You Show School will lose-

00:01:55.450 --> 00:01:57.400
We'll see about that.

00:01:57.860 --> 00:02:02.330
You don't know how strong our Reiji is.

00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:04.450
Reiji?

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:08.000
Enough with the cheering contest.

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:14.010
From this point forward, 
watch our duel in silence.

00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:16.900
I've seen him before.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:19.480
I was right!

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:22.300
Reiji Akaba.

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:37.000
He's scary.

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:40.550
What's wrong with Yuya?

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:42.850
He's concentrating on the match.

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:50.850
But he's not acting like himself.

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:55.250
Yuya, smile!

00:02:56.450 --> 00:03:00.430
You Show School teaches happy 
and fun entertainment dueling!

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:03.150
Don't forget your smile!

00:03:03.150 --> 00:03:04.750
Smile...

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.550
She's right.

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:13.070
Entertaining with happiness 
and fun is my motto.

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:16.400
I must never forget that!

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:18.250
All right, I'll show you!

00:03:18.850 --> 00:03:23.000
I'll show you the best 
smile and the best dueling!

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.500
Hooray!

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:29.820
I wonder how long that 
smile is going to last.

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:32.200
What should we do about the Action Field?

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:33.750
Choose whatever you like.

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:41.100
Yuya is letting me choose again.

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:46.100
But if he's really Reiji Akaba...

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:52.950
He's a pro level duelist.

00:03:52.950 --> 00:04:01.200
This may be unfair, but in order to protect Yuya and 
our school, I'll choose a field best suited for Yuya.

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:06.730
Yuya, give your best entertainment 
on the best stage!

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:08.650
Action Field on!

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:12.850
I activate the Field Spell Acrobatic Circus!

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:33.500
It's a circus!

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:36.400
Yuya is an expert on this field.

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:39.790
Principal, you're being 
chivalrous by helping him!

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:42.450
I did everything I could do.

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:44.760
The rest is up to you, Yuya.

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:46.600
Thank you, Principal.

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:49.450
An entertainer fulfills the 
audience's expectations.

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:52.740
I'll show everyone a great duel!

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:05.280
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:08.700
Along with their monsters, they'll kick 
the ground and fly through the sky...

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:11.050
...to move around the field!

00:05:11.050 --> 00:05:14.390
Witness dueling's greatest evolution!

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:16.400
Action!

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:18.350
Duel!

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:26.170
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:34.350
In duels where the field, monsters and duelists 
become one, the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:38.350
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:57.130
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:05:57.450 --> 00:06:00.540
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:09.280
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:13.850
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:16.050
Impulse  Got it got it

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:21.260
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:32.020
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:38.940
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:42.880
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:46.280
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:56.560
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:59.900
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:09.950
D/D/D  Different Dimension Kings

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:15.450
As a reward for letting me choose 
the field, I'll let you go first.

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:17.930
Reward?  Let me?

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:19.920
I see.

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:22.580
So that's what you think.

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:26.730
Fine.  I accept your offer.

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:28.680
It's my turn.

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:32.580
I activate three spell cards from my hand.

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:34.630
This is the first one.

00:07:34.630 --> 00:07:38.630
I activate the Continuous Spell 
Dark Contract with the Gate!

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:45.810
With this card, every time it's my Standby 
Phase, I take 1000 points of damage.

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:49.130
Every time it's his turn...

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:52.950
He takes 1000 points of damage?

00:07:52.950 --> 00:08:02.390
Once per turn, I can add one Level 
4-or-below D/D monster from my deck to my hand.

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:07.130
I add D/D Cerberus to my hand.

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:08.530
D/D?

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:10.480
Different Dimension.

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:12.470
It means it's an alternate dimension.

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:18.680
The second spell card is also 
Dark Contract with the Gate.

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:23.080
What?  That means on his next turn...

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:25.220
He'll take 2000 points of damage.

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:33.230
Just as before, I can add Level 
4-or-below D/D monster to my hand.

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:36.900
I add D/D Lilith to my hand.

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:43.870
The third spell card I activate is the 
Continuous Spell Dark Contract with the Swamp King.

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:50.510
Due to this card, I take 1000 points 
of damage during my Standby Phase.

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:53.900
It's now 3000 points of damage.

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:56.580
Why is he taking this huge risk?

00:08:56.580 --> 00:09:05.980
Once per turn, Dark Contract with the Swamp King lets me Fusion 
Summon a Fiend-Type Fusion Monster without using Polymerization.

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:11.130
Fusion Summon without Polymerization?

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:16.530
I fuse D/D Cerberus and D/D Lilith.

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:20.180
Hell's guard dog that bares its fangs.

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:22.730
The enchantress who wanders the dark night!

00:09:22.730 --> 00:09:29.330
Within the swirling light of the realm of the 
dead, become one and give birth to the new king!

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:31.580
Fusion Summon!

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:36.830
Be born, D/D/D Flame King Genghis!

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:41.030
Incredible.

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:43.180
He's a Fusion user?

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:47.330
But why would he risk so 
much to summon that monster?

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:49.480
This time, it's D/D/D.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:51.080
Three D's.

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:52.730
What does that mean?

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:56.330
He's completely different than the others.

00:09:57.180 --> 00:10:00.580
Is he the real deal?  But...

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:12.230
There's no record that Reiji Akaba used 
Fusion Summon in his previous matches.

00:10:12.230 --> 00:10:16.700
He's showing overwhelming 
power without using it before.

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:23.130
If he's gotten stronger 
than before, can Yuya win?

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:30.610
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:33.810
The two remaining cards in his hand?

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:36.080
Now he has zero cards in his hand.

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:52.530
What's with his arrogant attitude?

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:56.430
Since he's battling fourth, that means he's 
a benchwarmer!  He shouldn't be so cocky!

00:10:56.430 --> 00:10:59.180
He is acting cocky.

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:05.880
Maybe he's risking taking 3000 points of 
damage because he's underestimating Yuya.

00:11:05.880 --> 00:11:07.380
No way!

00:11:07.380 --> 00:11:10.640
How rude to underestimate your opponent!

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:15.230
He doesn't deserve to be called a duelist!

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:17.180
Defeat that guy!

00:11:17.180 --> 00:11:20.130
Yeah!  Totally take him down!

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:22.830
Pummel him until it makes me shiver!

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:28.800
Okay!  But it's my entertainment 
dueling that will make you shiver!

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:30.280
My turn!

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:31.740
I draw!

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:37.810
I summon Performapal Whip Snake!

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:46.420
Whip Snake's effect activates!

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:51.180
Your monster switches its 
attack and defense points!

00:11:57.580 --> 00:12:00.380
Genghis's attack points decreased!

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:03.630
Whip Snake has 1700 attack points.

00:12:03.630 --> 00:12:05.080
It can now destroy it!

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:07.340
It makes me shiver!

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:12.380
Let's battle!  Whip Snake 
attacks Flame King Genghis!

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:18.450
I activate the Continuous Trap 
Dark Contract with the Witch!

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:20.720
Another Contract?

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:22.030
That means...

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:29.100
During my turn's Standby Phase, 
I take 1000 points of damage.

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:35.680
A Fiend-Type monster on my 
field gains 1000 attack points.

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:41.670
This means Whip Snake's attack won't succeed!

00:12:43.880 --> 00:12:46.780
I activate the Action Card High Dive!

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:53.420
Whip Snake gains 1000 attack 
points until the End Phase.

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:00.760
Nicely done!

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:02.230
He once again...

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:03.580
...turned the tables!

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:05.430
It makes me shiver!

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:09.830
Go, Whip Snake!  Attack Flame King Genghis!

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:26.730
He did it!

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:32.330
What's going on?

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:33.430
No way!

00:13:40.430 --> 00:13:42.180
No way...

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:45.900
I also activated an Action Card.

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:49.330
The Action Spell Evasion.

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:54.750
You're pretty skilled.

00:13:56.950 --> 00:14:00.150
They're evenly matched so far.

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:01.880
No, you're wrong!

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:09.080
The opponent activated four Contracts, so he'll 
take 4000 points of damage on his next Standby Phase.

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:10.130
In other words...

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:15.100
If Yuya ends his turn, his 
opponent will have 0 life points!

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:17.830
So Yuya wins?

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:19.380
That was quick.

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:21.070
He made a strategic mistake.

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:22.830
Are you sure about that?

00:14:23.580 --> 00:14:28.780
I don't think he's the type 
who makes simple mistakes.

00:14:29.230 --> 00:14:38.130
And right before Whip Snake attacked, I wonder 
why Genghis's attack points changed from 2500 to 1500.

00:14:55.940 --> 00:14:57.580
What's so funny?

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:59.080
My apologies.

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:05.930
I was thinking back to when you 
offered to let me go first.

00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:10.280
It seems you're a kindhearted person.

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:18.200
But that kindness won't help 
you on the battlefield!

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:26.180
You can win if you end your 
turn, but you're hesitating.

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:29.280
That's due to your kindness.

00:15:29.930 --> 00:15:33.930
I wonder where that weakness will lead.

00:15:34.150 --> 00:15:36.280
What is he talking about?

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:37.880
Don't hesitate, Yuya!

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:39.530
That's right!  Finish him!

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:41.120
Hurry up and end your turn!

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:49.230
I set one card and end my turn!

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:58.430
Whip Snake's effect switched Genghis's attack 
and defense points, but they now return to normal!

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:05.330
High Dive's effect also ends, so Whip 
Snake's attack points return to normal.

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:13.630
Due to the effects of your Contracts, 
you now take 4000 points of damage!

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:19.330
Contracts?  What do you mean?

00:16:23.430 --> 00:16:24.830
What happened?

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:27.130
The Contracts are negated.

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:32.430
I already activated the trap 
card Contract Laundering.

00:16:32.730 --> 00:16:44.480
Contract Laundering activates by negating the effects of all 
Contracts, and all Contracts are destroyed during the End Phase.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:45.730
I see!

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:52.190
Dark Contract with the Witch was negated, so 
that's why Genghis's attack points returned to 1500.

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:55.900
4000 points of damage were negated!

00:16:55.900 --> 00:17:02.570
And for every card that was destroyed, 
I draw a card from my deck!

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:09.860
So that's my weakness...

00:17:10.520 --> 00:17:19.250
But even if I won, I wouldn't be happy because the audience was 
looking forward to seeing something awesome from my entertainment dueling.

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:23.700
From your point of view, it 
might look like a weakness.

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:32.080
But I'm going to win my way!  By using the 
entertainment dueling that I learned from my dad!

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:34.680
Win using Yusho Sakaki's dueling.

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:39.280
You know my dad?

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:41.780
Of course we do.

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:44.680
Your dad is famous.

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:47.680
As a former champion who ran away.

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:48.830
Silence!

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:51.580
Idiots.

00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:54.180
My apologies.

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:57.480
Of course I know your father.

00:17:58.080 --> 00:18:05.000
He's a pioneer who built up Action Duels into the 
success it experiences today, so I admire him deeply.

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:10.830
I'll make you show me the dueling 
that you inherited from your father.

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:16.380
That means I'll have to get serious.

00:18:16.380 --> 00:18:18.130
Get serious?

00:18:18.130 --> 00:18:19.730
You weren't serious yet?

00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:22.280
My turn.  I draw!

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:28.630
I summon the Level 3 Tuner 
Monster D/D Nighthowl!

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:33.380
Tuner Monster?

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:35.330
Can it be?

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:39.930
It's time for the main event.

00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:52.730
When it's summoned, I can Special Summon a Level 4-or-below 
D/D monster from the graveyard by lowering its attack points to 0.

00:18:53.180 --> 00:18:57.380
I resurrect D/D Lilith!

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:10.380
Level 3 D/D Nighthowl 
tunes Level 4 D/D Lilith!

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:32.130
The roar that cuts through the darkness, gain 
the speed of a gale and give rise to a new king!

00:19:33.890 --> 00:19:35.880
Synchro Summon!

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:42.130
Be born, Level 7 D/D/D Gust King Alexander!

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:46.830
Synchro Monster?

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:54.430
He can use more than Fusion?

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:56.730
I'm not done.

00:19:56.730 --> 00:20:01.780
I activate D/D/D Flame King Genghis's effect!

00:20:01.780 --> 00:20:12.980
When another D/D/D monster is Special Summoned, I 
can Special Summon a D/D monster from the graveyard!

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:17.080
Resurrect again, D/D Lilith!

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:25.030
D/D/D Gust King Alexander's effect activates!

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:35.050
When a D/D monster is Special Summoned, I can 
Special Summon a D/D monster from the graveyard!

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:38.290
Resurrect, D/D Cerberus!

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:47.830
I overlay Level 4 D/D 
Lilith and D/D Cerberus!

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:50.750
What?

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:54.520
With these two monsters, I 
build the Overlay Network!

00:20:55.950 --> 00:21:01.720
In order to rule all of existence, 
descend at the world's spire!

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:04.010
This is...

00:21:04.010 --> 00:21:06.350
Xyz Summon!

00:21:06.350 --> 00:21:10.980
Be born, Rank 4 Wave King Caesar!

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:16.630
He even uses Xyz Monsters.

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:18.860
He's unbelievable.

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:35.010
He's mastered three summoning methods.

00:21:35.010 --> 00:21:37.720
This is Reiji Akaba.

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:43.890
D/D/D stands for Different Dimension Demon.

00:21:45.260 --> 00:21:51.090
Taste the power of the demon kings that 
have conquered different dimensions.

00:22:13.460 --> 00:22:18.940
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:28.420
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:35.310 --> 00:22:40.430
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:40.690 --> 00:22:45.670
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:45.960 --> 00:22:51.110
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:51.360 --> 00:22:56.370
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:56.570 --> 00:23:01.970
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:01.970 --> 00:23:06.390
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:06.680 --> 00:23:12.360
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:17.770
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:17.770 --> 00:23:23.100
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:23.100 --> 00:23:32.440
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:33.440 --> 00:23:40.660
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:46.350 --> 00:23:54.000
Everyone, Yuya Sakaki will show you 
entertainment dueling that only he can do!

00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:56.520
Odd-Eyes went through a ring of flames!

00:23:56.520 --> 00:23:59.320
I can't believe he used that 
technique to power it up!

00:23:59.320 --> 00:24:03.320
He's a beast master - I 
mean - a dragon master!

00:24:03.320 --> 00:24:05.320
It makes me shiver!

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:10.290
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
D/D Savant Galilei and Kepler

00:24:10.290 --> 00:24:12.860
The fun is only getting started!
